{title: The Kingdom Song}
{artist: Darrell Evans}
{key: A}

{comment: Intro}
[A2] [A7] [A2] [A7] [A2] [D2] [A2]  (muted)

{comment: Verse}
[A7]From eternity to eternity [A2]Your kingdom will [A7]ever reign   [A2]
You are the one God,[D2] Jesus,     [Bm11]
And we bear Your name         [A2]
[A7]From the rulers north, to the rulers south  [A2]
To the [A7]kingdoms east and west           [A2]
They'll bow before [D2]You       [Bm11]
Your Lordship confess    [A2]

{comment: Bridge}
[F#m]Your [G2]oceans clap their [F#m]hands
Your [G2]trees [F#m]they wave their branches
Your [G2]rivers run with praise[D2]
[E]All creation will praise    [A2]    [Bm11]  [D2]  [E]

{comment: Chorus}
[A7]Lord we [Bm11]delight in Your truth
Your [D2]kingdom's advancing
And Lord [E]we are moving with You          [A2]
Lord, we delight [Bm11]in Your reign
[D2]Creation will praise You
And Lord [E]we exalt Your great name          [A2]
